{"abstract":[{"text":"Receive the credentials a Credential Offer offers, with either grant,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and look after them once they’re held.","type":"text"}],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"minor":3,"major":0},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/receivingcredentials"]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Overview","anchor":"Overview","type":"heading","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"An issuer offers credentials with an ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"openid-credential-offer:\/\/"},{"text":" link,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"as a QR code or a link the holder opens. Register the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"openid-credential-offer"},{"type":"text","text":" URL scheme in the app’s Info.plist so links"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"open the app, and hand the link to "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet\/startIssuance(offer:)"},{"type":"text","text":". It"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"resolves the offer and the issuer’s metadata, and returns an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Issuance"},{"type":"text","text":" whose "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Issuance\/offer"},{"type":"text","text":" you show the holder: who is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"offering what."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The offer names one of two grants:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Authorization code:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" the holder signs in at the issuer’s pages, in"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"a browser, which redirects back to the wallet’s redirect URI."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Pre-authorized code:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" the issuer has already authenticated the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"holder, and may ask for a PIN it sent them separately"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"("},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Offer\/txCode-swift.property"},{"text":").","type":"text"}]}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Either way, ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Issuance\/requestCredentials()"},{"text":" then requests, checks and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"stores the credentials, and ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Issuance\/close()"},{"text":" ends the issuance.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Receive-an-offer","type":"heading","text":"Receive an offer","level":3},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["import AuthenticationServices","import Foundation","import OID4VCWallet","","\/\/\/ Receives the credentials an offer link offers. `confirm` shows the","\/\/\/ holder who is offering what, and returns whether they want it;","\/\/\/ `askPIN` asks for the PIN the issuer sent, or returns nil if they","\/\/\/ cancel; `signIn` opens the issuer's page and returns the redirect","\/\/\/ back.","func receive(offerLink: String, wallet: Wallet,","             confirm: (Offer) async -> Bool,","             askPIN: (Offer.TxCode?) async -> String?,","             signIn: (URL) async throws -> URL) async throws -> Issuance.Result? {","    let issuance = try await wallet.startIssuance(offer: offerLink)","    do {","        guard await confirm(issuance.offer) else {","            try await issuance.close()","            return nil","        }","        switch issuance.offer.grant {","        case .preAuthorizedCode:","            while true {","                guard let pin = await askPIN(issuance.offer.txCode) else {","                    try await issuance.close()","                    return nil","                }","                do {","                    try await issuance.redeemPreAuthorizedCode(pin: pin)","                    break","                } catch let error as WalletError where error.isRetryable {","                    continue \/\/ A wrong PIN (invalid_grant): ask again.","                }","            }","        case .authorizationCode:","            let url = try await issuance.beginAuthorization()","            let redirect = try await signIn(url)","            try await issuance.completeAuthorization(redirect: redirect)","        }","        let result = try await issuance.requestCredentials()","        try await issuance.close()","        return result","    } catch {","        \/\/ End the issuance whatever failed, deleting its keys.","        try? await issuance.close()","        throw error","    }","}"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Show the offer before anything is redeemed: the issuer’s name and the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"credentials it offers, so the holder can turn down an offer they didn’t"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"expect. Close the issuance on every path, as here: its keys are"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"deleted then, but for those a deferred credential still needs."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Issuance\/Result"},{"type":"text","text":" lists what arrived, what the issuer deferred, and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"what failed: one credential the issuer refused doesn’t hold up the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"rest."}]},{"text":"Open the issuer’s page","anchor":"Open-the-issuers-page","type":"heading","level":3},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Open the authorization URL in an "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ASWebAuthenticationSession"},{"type":"text","text":", with the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"redirect URI’s scheme as its callback scheme. An ephemeral session"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"keeps the issuer’s cookies out of Safari’s."}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["\/\/\/ Opens issuers' authorization pages over `window`.","@MainActor","final class IssuerSignIn: NSObject, ASWebAuthenticationPresentationContextProviding {","    private let window: ASPresentationAnchor","    private let callbackScheme: String","","    init(window: ASPresentationAnchor, callbackScheme: String) {","        self.window = window","        self.callbackScheme = callbackScheme","    }","","    nonisolated func presentationAnchor(for session: ASWebAuthenticationSession) -> ASPresentationAnchor {","        MainActor.assumeIsolated { window }","    }","","    \/\/\/ The issuer's redirect back, or `ASWebAuthenticationSessionError`","    \/\/\/ `.canceledLogin` when the holder closes the page.","    func open(_ url: URL) async throws -> URL {","        try await withCheckedThrowingContinuation { continuation in","            let session = ASWebAuthenticationSession(url: url, callbackURLScheme: callbackScheme) { redirect, error in","                if let redirect {","                    continuation.resume(returning: redirect)","                } else {","                    continuation.resume(throwing: error ?? URLError(.unknown))","                }","            }","            session.presentationContextProvider = self","            session.prefersEphemeralWebBrowserSession = true","            session.start()","        }","    }","}"]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If the holder closes the page, the offer stays open:"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Issuance\/beginAuthorization()"},{"type":"text","text":" can begin again. A redirect is used"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"up by "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Issuance\/completeAuthorization(redirect:)"},{"type":"text","text":" whatever happens,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"so after a failure there, begin again rather than retrying it."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Resume-after-the-app-is-killed","type":"heading","level":3,"text":"Resume after the app is killed"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"iOS can terminate the app while the holder is at the issuer’s pages."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The authorization in progress is kept in the credential store, so when"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the redirect arrives at a relaunched app, "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet\/resumeIssuance(redirect:)"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"completes it and returns an issuance ready for"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Issuance\/requestCredentials()"},{"type":"text","text":". Handle every redirect this way: in"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"SwiftUI, from "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"onOpenURL"},{"type":"text","text":". Outside development, resuming needs a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"redirectURI"},{"type":"text","text":" with the app’s own URI scheme, such as"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"com.example.wallet:\/callback"},{"type":"text","text":", so "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Wallet"},{"type":"text","text":" refuses an https Universal"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Link there. In development too, the scheme must be a domain name in"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"reverse order followed by a single slash, "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"reverse.domain:\/path"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"(RFC 8252 §7.1): "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Wallet"},{"type":"text","text":" refuses "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"myapp:\/callback"},{"type":"text","text":","},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"com.example.wallet:\/\/callback"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"com.example.wallet:callback"},{"type":"text","text":" as"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"invalidInput"},{"type":"text","text":", and any redirect URI with a fragment or credentials."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["\/\/\/ Completes an authorization the app was killed during, from the","\/\/\/ redirect iOS delivers to the relaunched app.","func resume(redirect: URL, wallet: Wallet) async throws -> Issuance.Result {","    let issuance = try await wallet.resumeIssuance(redirect: redirect)","    let result = try await issuance.requestCredentials()","    try await issuance.close()","    return result","}"],"type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A redirect that matches no authorization in progress throws"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletError\/Code-swift.struct\/notFound"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Wait for a deferred credential","anchor":"Wait-for-a-deferred-credential","type":"heading","level":3},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"An issuer may issue a credential later, after a review, say. It’s kept"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"in the credential store until it’s issued, denied or abandoned, so it"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"survives the app quitting. "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet\/deferredCredentials()"},{"type":"text","text":" lists them"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"without network requests; poll each at the interval the issuer asks for."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["\/\/\/ Polls a deferred credential until the issuer settles it: the","\/\/\/ credential, or a `.credentialDenied` error.","func waitFor(_ deferred: DeferredCredential, wallet: Wallet) async throws -> CredentialSummary {","    var interval = deferred.intervalSeconds","    while true {","        try await Task.sleep(for: .seconds(max(interval, 5)))","        switch try await wallet.pollDeferred(id: deferred.id) {","        case .issued(let credential): return credential","        case .pending(let next): interval = next","        }","    }","}"],"type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet\/abandonDeferred(id:)"},{"type":"text","text":" gives one up, deleting its keys: once"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"its access token has expired, say ("},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/DeferredCredential\/accessTokenExpiresAt"},{"type":"text","text":")."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Look after held credentials","anchor":"Look-after-held-credentials","type":"heading","level":3},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet\/credentials()","isActive":true},{"text":" lists them, and ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet\/credential(id:)","isActive":true},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"returns one with its claims, for display. ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/CredentialSummary\/display","isActive":true},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"carries the issuer’s names, logos and colours, in the holder’s","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"language (","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/locales","isActive":true},{"text":").","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet\/checkStatus(id:)","isActive":true},{"text":" checks revocation against the issuer’s","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"status list, which covers many credentials, so the issuer can’t tell","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"which one is checked.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Each credential arrives as a batch of copies, each bound to its own","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"key (","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/batchSize","isActive":true},{"text":"), so presentations can’t be","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"linked by the credential. When ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/CredentialSummary\/copiesLeft","isActive":true},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"reaches zero, ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet\/refreshCredential(id:)","isActive":true},{"text":" replaces them, if the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"issuance kept a refresh token (","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/requestRefresh","isActive":true},{"text":").","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Otherwise it throws ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletError\/Code-swift.struct\/reissueRequired","isActive":true},{"text":": receive the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"credential again. A refresh needs no sign-in, but the new copies’","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"holder keys sign the Credential Request’s proof, so with","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/KeychainKeyStore\/Options-swift.struct\/holderUserPresence","isActive":true},{"text":" on it","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"asks the holder too.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet\/deleteCredential(id:)","isActive":true},{"text":" deletes a credential and its keys,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"revoking its refresh token at the issuer.","type":"text"}]}]}],"type":"unorderedList"}]}],"kind":"article","hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet"]]},"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"OID4VCWallet"}],"role":"article","roleHeading":"Article","title":"Receiving credentials"},"seeAlsoSections":[{"anchor":"Receiving-credentials","title":"Receiving credentials","identifiers":["doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Issuance","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Offer","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/DeferredCredential","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/DeferredStatus"],"generated":true}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/ReceivingCredentials"},"sections":[],"references":{"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/Wallet/deferredCredentials()":{"url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/wallet\/deferredcredentials()","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet\/deferredCredentials()","role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","title":"deferredCredentials()","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The credentials issuers have deferred and not yet settled, oldest"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"first — including ones from before the app last quit. Makes no"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"network calls: poll each at its interval."}],"fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"deferredCredentials","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"() ","kind":"text"},{"text":"async","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"throws","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" -> [","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:12OID4VCWallet18DeferredCredentialV","text":"DeferredCredential","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"]","kind":"text"}]},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/KeychainKeyStore/Options-swift.struct/holderUserPresence":{"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/keychainkeystore\/options-swift.struct\/holderuserpresence","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/KeychainKeyStore\/Options-swift.struct\/holderUserPresence","role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"Require user presence (Face ID, Touch ID or the passcode) for","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"every signature with a holder key: to present a credential,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and to sign the Credential Request’s jwt proofs, so receiving","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and refreshing credentials ask too — once per copy","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"(","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/batchSize","isActive":true},{"text":"), or once per Credential","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Request when its jwt proof carries a key attestation, and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"again if the issuer refuses the nonce — and a refresh can’t","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"run without the holder. The Secure Enclave","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"enforces it. Off, the app asks for it itself (with","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"LAContext.evaluatePolicy"},{"text":") before every presentation — in","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the app, from a link, through a document provider extension,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and in person — a check the app’s own code keeps, not the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"key. For Face ID, the app’s Info.plist must have an","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NSFaceIDUsageDescription"},{"text":"; without one, iOS asks for the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"passcode instead.","type":"text"}],"title":"holderUserPresence","fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"holderUserPresence","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb","text":"Bool","kind":"typeIdentifier"}]},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/DeferredStatus":{"abstract":[{"text":"A deferred credential’s state, from ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Wallet.pollDeferred(id:)"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"role":"symbol","title":"DeferredStatus","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/deferredstatus","type":"topic","fragments":[{"text":"enum","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"DeferredStatus","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"DeferredStatus","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/DeferredStatus"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/Wallet/startIssuance(offer:)":{"fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"startIssuance","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"offer","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"async","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"throws","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" -> ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:12OID4VCWallet8IssuanceC","text":"Issuance","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet\/startIssuance(offer:)","title":"startIssuance(offer:)","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/wallet\/startissuance(offer:)","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Resolves a Credential Offer (openid-credential-offer:\/\/…) and the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"issuer’s metadata."}],"type":"topic"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/CredentialSummary/display":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"How to show it, from the issuer’s metadata when it was received."}],"role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/credentialsummary\/display","type":"topic","title":"display","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"let"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"display"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"CredentialDisplay","preciseIdentifier":"s:12OID4VCWallet17CredentialDisplayV"},{"kind":"text","text":"?"}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/CredentialSummary\/display"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/Issuance/requestCredentials()":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Requests, checks and stores every offered credential."}],"role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/issuance\/requestcredentials()","type":"topic","title":"requestCredentials()","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"requestCredentials"},{"kind":"text","text":"() "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"async"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"throws"},{"kind":"text","text":" -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Result","preciseIdentifier":"s:12OID4VCWallet8IssuanceC6ResultV"}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Issuance\/requestCredentials()"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/Issuance/completeAuthorization(redirect:)":{"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"completeAuthorization"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"redirect"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:10Foundation3URLV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"URL"},{"kind":"text","text":") "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"async"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"throws"}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Issuance\/completeAuthorization(redirect:)","role":"symbol","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/issuance\/completeauthorization(redirect:)","abstract":[{"text":"Completes the authorization with the issuer’s redirect back. The","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"redirect is used up whatever happens: if this fails — the token","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"request didn’t get through, say — call ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"beginAuthorization()"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"again, rather than retrying this.","type":"text"}],"title":"completeAuthorization(redirect:)"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet":{"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet","role":"collection","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet","abstract":[{"text":"Receive verifiable credentials and present them from an iOS app: over","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"OpenID4VCI and OpenID4VP under HAIP, to Safari’s Digital Credentials","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"API, and in person over Bluetooth.","type":"text"}],"title":"OID4VCWallet"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/WalletError/Code-swift.struct/reissueRequired":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A credential can’t be refreshed: no refresh token was kept, or"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the Authorization Server no longer accepts it. Receive it again"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"from a new offer."}],"role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/walleterror\/code-swift.struct\/reissuerequired","type":"topic","title":"reissueRequired","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"static"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"let"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"reissueRequired"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"WalletError","preciseIdentifier":"s:12O